Although 55 per cent of Colorado voters have supported the measure, providing an appropriate legal and governmental framework for the personal consumption of marijuana is not an affluent.
And controversial reactions that have been observed in different American cities highlight the profound ambivalence among local officials regarding the legalization of marijuana.
